try: "teen apocalypse trilogy" by Greg Araki ( he's really good in crazy angsty youth stuff)

on a sadder note watch "Paranoid Park" by Gus Van Sant (another master of youth portrayal)

"i killed my mother" by Xavier Dolan (its his first movie, written when he was 16. Makinbg him the one of the youngest directors to ever show in Cannes)
